  triage:title "Duplicate test artifact: unique_name_a19 exists as both a table-driven case and a standalone test fn in roster_store.rs" ;
  triage:description "quality-mgr qa-pr1310-r9 (PR #1310, AY.15 herdr-name-uniqueness, head 3259d6a72; report: PR #1310 issuecomment 5576663523). Minor. crates/atm-storage-rusqlite/src/roster_store.rs carries the A-19 scenario twice: as a Case id in the table-driven unique_name matrix test (line 800) and as a standalone #[test] fn of the same name (line 983). Both exercise the same behaviour; one is leftover from the round-8 fix. Correction: delete one copy (keep the table-driven case so the matrix stays one row per test) and confirm the matrix doc citation for A-19 points at the surviving test. Non-blocking; rides the next PR touching roster_store.rs. Merged into integrate/phase-ay at 47f359cf9." ;
