  triage:closureNote "Confirmed fixed at phase-ay gate round 3 (PR #1318, integrate/phase-ay 75c01a5bd). Independently re-verified by quality-mgr via direct file/grep reads (not taken on cipher's commit message alone), cross-checked against schema-reviewer/rust-qa-agent live results. Duplicate standalone test unique_name_a19_removing_a_member_frees_its_effective_name removed from roster_store.rs; sole coverage is the table-driven case at line 800; 12/12 tests pass, no regression." ;
